      "name": "Glowing Mucus",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The vampire squid is in water</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The vampire squid ejects a cloud of bioluminescent mucus in a 15ft Cone. Non-squid creatures within the cloud must attempt a DC 16 Fortitude Saving Throw save or become Sickened 1. The glowing mucus remains in the area for 1 minute, and any creature that ends its turn in the area must succeed at a DC 13 Fortitude Saving Throw save or become Sickened 1.</p>",
